This licence is an agreement between you (the "Licensee") and [SELLER NAME] (the
"Licensor") about the AirStation software, including its source code, scripts,
configuration files, web pages, images and documentation (the "Software").

1. TRIAL
   You may install and use the Software free of charge for 30 days to evaluate it.
   After the trial, using the Studio administration pages requires a licence key.

2. LICENCE GRANT
   When you buy a licence and receive a licence key, the Licensor grants you a
   perpetual, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to:
   a) install and run the Software for ONE radio station (one public domain name) at
      a time, on servers you control or rent;
   b) change the Software's code, configuration and appearance for your own station;
   c) make backup copies.
   "Lifetime" means for as long as you comply with this licence. It includes the
   versions released while the Licensor sells this edition; it does not promise
   future features, support or a time limit for updates.

3. RESTRICTIONS
   You may not:
   a) sell, give away, publish, sublicense or otherwise distribute the Software or
      modified versions of it, in whole or in part, or your licence key;
   b) remove, disable or work around the licence check, or help others do so;
   c) offer the Software to third parties as a hosted service (for example, running
      stations for other people) without a separate written agreement;
   d) remove copyright or licence notices.
   Theme packs (your own images, texts, colours and CSS/JavaScript) may be shared
   freely, as long as they contain no part of the Software.

4. ACTIVATION
   The licence key is activated online. Activation sends the licence server the key,
   the station's domain name, a random installation identifier and the Software
   version, and the installation checks in about once a week. No other data is sent.
   You may move your licence to another server by deactivating the old one in the
   Studio, or by contacting the Licensor.

5. THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
   The Software works with separate programs that are not part of it and are
   distributed under their own licences (for example Icecast, Liquidsoap, Caddy,
   MediaMTX, NodeBB and Rauthy). See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. This licence does not
   change your rights under those licences.

6. YOUR CONTENT AND YOUR RESPONSIBILITIES
   You are responsible for the music and other content you broadcast, including any
   broadcasting or performance licences required where you and your listeners are,
   and for complying with privacy law for any listener statistics you collect.

7. NO WARRANTY
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED,
   INCLUDING MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NON-INFRINGEMENT,
   TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW. [Consumer-law note: in some countries, e.g.
   Australia, consumer guarantees cannot be excluded; your lawyer will adjust this.]

8. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY
   TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, THE LICENSOR'S TOTAL LIABILITY UNDER THIS LICENCE
